# nabu (Xiaomi Pad 5, SM8150) read-only UFS board port
#
# Base: UniXNU/NativeUfs af785c1777161a62931425c2faaa536ce0bebd5b (unmodified upstream).
# Apply to a fresh copy of that checkout; never to the reference tree itself.
#
# This ports the production read path only: probe/compatible, the controller window
# (DT 0x1d84000+0x2500, mapped page-rounded), the apps_smmu window (0x15000000+0x100000)
# and its UFS stream (0x300), and a read-only SM8150 GCC table (gcc-sm8150.c).
# It does not touch GCC or the PHY at run time, opens no write window, builds no
# WRITE(10), and keeps the sheng Data-store / diagnostic-log boot arguments inert.
#
# The base has no ordinary IOBlockStorageDevice export; IOStorageFamily bindings
# are still needed before linking. Applying this patch alone proves no boot or I/O.
