+// SM8550 (sheng) GCC registers used by UFS, transcribed as facts from the public
+// Linux gcc-sm8550.c clock driver. The nabu (SM8150) port does not include this
+// header: it carries its own read-only table in NabuBoard.h. No write is performed.
